rwhelmed by her beauty and the natural fragrance of her hair. To praise her and reassure himself of her divine perfection, he addresses a bee that flies from flower to flower. He asks the bee to speak honestly, without any bias or desire to flatter him, and tell him if any flower it knows has a fragrance sweeter than his beloved's hair. The imagery of the bee, the peacock-like grace of the woman, and the lush mountain flowers perfectly evoke the intimate, passionate atmosphere of Kurinci. Key words include 'தும்பி' (bee), 'கூந்தல்' (hair), and 'நறியவும்' (fragrant things).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,1.9],[1.9,3.4],[3.4,3.7],[3.7,3.9],[3.9,4.2],[4.2,4.6],[4.6,5.9],[5.9,6.6],[6.6,7.2],[7.2,7.6],[7.6,9.2],[9.2,9.7],[9.7,11.1],[11.1,11.3],[11.3,12.1],[12.1,12.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.66],[1.66,2.0],[2.0,3.3],[3.3,3.7],[3.7,3.9],[3.9,4.3],[4.3,4.7],[4.7,6.1],[6.1,6.8],[6.8,7.5],[7.5,7.88],[7.88,9.4],[9.4,10.0],[10.0,11.4],[11.4,11.6],[11.6,12.5],[12.5,12.8]]},"sync":[[["கொங்கு","pollen"],["தேர்","seeking"]],[["வாழ்க்கை","livelihood"]],[["அம்","beautiful"],["சிறை","winged"],["தும்பி","bee"]],[["தும்பி","bee"]],[["காமம்","bias"]],[["செப்பாது","without speaking (with bias)"]],[["கண்டது","what you saw"]],[["மொழிமோ","please speak"]],[["பயிலியது","closely associated"]],[["கெழீஇய","intimate"]],[["நட்பின்","of friendship"]],[["மயில்","peacock"],["இயல்","graceful nature"]],[["செறி","close-set"],["எயிற்று","teeth"]],[["எயிற்று","teeth"],["அரிவை","young woman"]],[["கூந்தலின்","than the hair"]],[["நறியவும்","fragrant things also"]],[["உளவோ","are there?"]],[["நீ","you"],["அறியும்","known"]],[["பூவே","among flowers"]]]}